      "widgets_values": [
        "Golden-hour surf shot. The girl rides inside the curl of the huge breaking wave, crouched on her yellow hibiscus surfboard with both bare feet planted on it. She shifts her weight and carves along the wave face, her arms moving for balance, her long braid and hair whipping in the wind. She glances up nervously at the wall of water curling over her. The wave keeps rolling and breaking behind her, white foam and spray flying, the water surface shimmering in the sunlight. The seagulls flap their wings and glide across the golden sky. The surfers in the background bob gently on their boards. The camera tracks smoothly alongside her. Smooth, natural motion, consistent with the source image's style."
