      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Models & LoRAs used by this flow — download links\n\nDownload on the host only (`ssh gaguilar@172.16.0.101`), into `~/git/ComfyUI/models/<folder>/`.\n\n| Folder | File | Download | Page |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | [Wan 2.2 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged) |\n| diffusion_models | wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | [Wan 2.2 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged) |\n| text_encoders | umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors) | [Wan 2.1 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged) |\n| vae | wan_2.1_vae.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors) | [Wan 2.2 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged) |\n| loras | wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors (strength 1.0, no trigger) | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/loras/wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors) | [lightx2v Wan2.2-Lightning](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning) |\n| loras | wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors (strength 1.0, no trigger) | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/loras/wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors) | [lightx2v Wan2.2-Lightning](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning) |\n| custom_nodes/comfyui-frame-interpolation/ckpts/rife | rife49.pth (RIFE 4.9 frame interpolation, group 05) | [file](https://github.com/styler00dollar/VSGAN-tensorrt-docker/releases/download/models/rife49.pth) | [ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation](https://github.com/Fannovel16/ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation) · [RIFE](https://github.com/hzwer/Practical-RIFE) |\n\nOptional, lower VRAM: GGUF versions of the UNets (load with `UnetLoaderGGUF`): [QuantStack/Wan2.2-I2V-A14B-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Wan2.2-I2V-A14B-GGUF).\n\nOfficial guide: [docs.comfy.org — Wan 2.2](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/wan/wan2_2)\n\n**Speed LoRA on (shipped):** 4 steps, cfg 1, split at step 2.\n**Bypassed (group 01):** 20 steps, cfg 3.5, split at step 10, on both samplers.\n"
      ],
      "title": "MODEL & LoRA LINKS",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1290,
        1360
      ],
      "size": [
        340,
